{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "localId": "0c032ae26cdf"}, "content": [{"text": "User Manual", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4dace5e160bf"}, "content": [{"text": "End users (lab technicians, biologists, pathologists) and lab administrators configuring the system day to day.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "ec5ac31d5c41"}, "content": [{"text": "Who this is for", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "497b8c7128fc"}, "content": [{"text": "You work in a laboratory and use OpenELIS Global to enter orders, record results, validate test outcomes, and run reports. Or you administer an OpenELIS installation \u2014 configuring tests, managing users, setting up barcodes and dictionaries, and keeping the system running smoothly for your colleagues. Both roles share most of the same documentation; what differs is how deep into the admin tooling you go.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "528bc86eb529"}, "content": [{"text": "What to read first", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "7b64f727ae89"}, "content": [{"text": "If you're a lab technician or biologist (end user)", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "c5beaeffb0ab", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "d20911c4f853"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "24ce954bab5d"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 1: Navigating OpenELIS Global", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/260931593"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 your first 10 minutes in the app. Login, menu, where things live.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "fa8630855e5a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3b3ec1644b6a"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 4: Entering Laboratory Orders", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/261423127"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 the most common workflow. Search patient, create order, generate barcode.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "45aa2ca3d12a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c41263101f40"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 12: Entering Lab Test Results", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/278626329"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 how to record results from the bench.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e1fc0be39da4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4663c58ab0b8"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 13: Results Validation (Biological Validation)", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/284196875"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 the supervisor-level review step.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4362eda40325"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "24ef7136f38c"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 14: Reports", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/284393490"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 pulling results out of the system.", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3b8a7cc524b7"}, "content": [{"text": "Once you've done a task once, switch to the ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "End User Quick Reference", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " versions of the same workflows \u2014 same content, no screenshots, fast to scan.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "565828af8006"}, "content": [{"text": "If you're a lab administrator", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "cccb29740aaf", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6d9f7e681bbc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4f05139f55ef"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 1: Introduction", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/257392644"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 what the admin module does and doesn't do.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "5cfa608c66fc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "262f942c0034"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 3: Accessing the OpenELIS Global Administration Module", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/257097754"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 how to get to the admin pages.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "8719e35562b5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bc93196bdc3e"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 5: Dictionary", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/256737340"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 configuring the system's lookup values.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "dcafc0e11c78"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "15740b2b2bf9"}, "content": [{"text": "PART 6: Test Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/257228825"}}]}, {"text": " \u2014 adding and managing tests, reflex rules.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "893b8418ea6d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7e6e7fcc88f0"}, "content": [{"text": "User Management", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type":