 read French / Si vous lisez le fran\u00e7ais", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "17bc15446a35"}, "content": [{"text": "The functional requirements documentation in French is at ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "Fonctionnalit\u00e9s d'OpenELIS", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/755728390"}}]}, {"text": ". Most user-facing documentation in the manual itself is still English-primary.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "3f9d27b6d021"}, "content": [{"text": "Cross-reference", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3f6e4c498ef8"}, "content": [{"text": "For specific features (Sample Storage, Westgard QC, Aliquots, Reflex Tests, etc.), go to ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "Modules & Features", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325727762"}}]}, {"text": ". For lab notebooks, see ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "Laboratory Notebooks", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}, {"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/991821864"}}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b802f06755bd"}, "content": [{"text": "Where to get help", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "c0baf82620e0"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "50f28120e485"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f751c1e74661"}, "content": [{"text": "Inside your lab", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 your lab administrator is the first point of contact for day-to-day questions about how OpenELIS is configured at your site.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "343640027504"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "140c4e96b57c"}, "content": [{"text": "OpenELIS Talk", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "talk.openelis-global.org", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}]}, {"text": " is the primary community discussion forum.", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "9d3381485197"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3dd0335e56d5"}, "content": [{"text": "Documentation feedback", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"text": " \u2014 see something that's out of date or unclear? Use Confluence's inline comments on the relevant page, or post in ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "OpenELIS Talk", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}]}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "67f284ddf2c4"}, "content": [{"text": "Stay current", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7dac1d99dea2"}, "content": [{"text": "The Confluence space is updated continuously as features ship. Click the bell icon at the top right of any page to be notified when it changes. The ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "Releases", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326219273"}}]}, {"text": " page tells you what's new in each version.", "type": "text"}]}], "version": 1}